  "ingredients": [
    "1.8 ounce peanuts",
    "10 drop liquid stevia",
    "salt (to taste)",
    "1/4 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "10 drop liquid stevia",
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/8 teaspoon salt",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened almond milk",
    "1 large egg",
    "15 drop liquid stevia",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1/4 teaspoon coconut oil",
    "1 tablespoon butter"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "To prepare the peanut filling from scratch, roast freshly shelled peanuts until brown.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grind the peanuts, stevia, and salt in a spice grinder or with a pestle and mortar. Set this mixture aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To prepare our keto condensed milk, heat up the heavy cream and liquid stevia in a saucepan and bring to a boil. Reduce the heat and simmer. It should thicken up and take on a consistency similar to that of condensed milk. Let cool and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, mix the almond flour, baking soda, baking powder, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the almond milk, egg, liquid stevia, vanilla, and half of the coconut oil. Combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small pan over medium heat, melt the half of the remaining coconut oil. Once hot, pour in half of the batter and cover the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "After about 1 minute, sprinkle over the peanut filling.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread some of the condensed milk mixture onto one half of the pancake and butter onto the other half. Cover the pan once more for a few minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once browned and cooked through, remove the pancake and let cool.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/03/6-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat steps 6–9 for the remaining pancakes. Once cooled, fold the pancakes and slice into bite-sized pieces. Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-peanut-pancakes/#wprm-recipe-51599-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
